{"candidateAnswer":"Calvin and Dave have nostalgic memories about their dads.","evidence":"[D12:2 | 1:12 pm on 3 August, 2023] Dave: Hey Calvin, I understand the stress of getting a car serviced. Fixing cars is like therapy for me. Growing up working on cars with my dad, refurbishing them gives me a sense of fulfillment.\n[D20:6 | 8:57 pm on 22 September, 2023] Calvin: Yeah, there's this one song that always makes me smile. It played during a road trip with my dad and we had so much fun singing along to it.","itemId":"urn:uuid:4b8dc429-8fa7-55a1-8e74-002e09e915eb","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:846ba50e2b05c0c1c8bb062b8a78d422fd5b54fe10a8f3e1c752d594685e9a1d","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which of their family member do Calvin and Dave have nostalgic memories about?","referenceAnswer":"Dad","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"846ba50e2b05c0c1c8bb062b8a78d422fd5b54fe10a8f3e1c752d594685e9a1d"}}]}